Subject: [PATCH 2/3] [guilib] Keep subpixel textures fractional only while
 they move

Static artwork with subpixel="true" stays as crisp as the default; the
fractional position is only kept while the texture's screen rect changes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
